Use the repository's Java build metadata first: `pom.xml`, `build.gradle`, `settings.gradle`, wrapper scripts, and lock/config files.

Common commands to test locally inside the image:

```bash
./mvnw test
mvn test
./gradlew test
gradle test
```

Java patching notes:

- Prefer repository wrapper scripts when present.
- Make the JDK version explicit.
- Keep Maven or Gradle caches separate from source edits.
- Treat compilation and classpath failures as environment errors until tests start normally.
